 86:                 <p className="font-['Oswald'] text-lg font-medium text-gray-800 uppercase tracking-wide">Your cart is empty</p>
 87:                 <p className="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Discover our exclusive bag collections and new arrivals.</p>
 88:                 <button
